   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line058",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "会社はそれを、佐藤個人との使用契約で借りていたにすぎない。条件は、ただ一つ。佐藤が、現場の責任者であること。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line059",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "さらに、国に届け出た電気主任技術者もまた、佐藤だった。彼を解雇したその瞬間、この設備は、法律上、いちびょうたりとも動かせなくなっていたのだ。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line060",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_64a66e30679f68b9bf301edb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "田中さん、主任技術者がいないまま試運転するのは、法律違反です！",
   "emotion_preset": "angry",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 1.05
  },
  {
   "id": "line061",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63478295af3bab65523c3237",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……構わない。押せ。止まるわけがない",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line062",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "試運転のスイッチが入った、その瞬間。変圧器から巨大な火花が散り、現場のすべての電気が消えた。",
   "emotion_preset": "toneup",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.05
  },
  {
   "id": "line063",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "だが、けが人は一人も出なかった。もりが守り抜いたあの古い遮断器が、最後の一瞬で、作業員たちの命を救ったのだ。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line064",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a8f9d53322676d2f0934a21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "だいとうテクノロジーの皆さん。経済産業省との、合同監査です",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line065",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a8f9d53322676d2f0934a21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "この事業の核心技術は、本日付で、使用契約がすべて解除されました。佐藤顧問の、正式な手続きでね",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line066",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a8f9d53322676d2f0934a21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "主任技術者なしの試運転。等級の改ざん。補助金の不正請求。……言い逃れは、できませんよ",
   "emotion_preset": "angry",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line067",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_673eb45cdc1073aef51e6b90",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "た、高橋ほんぶちょう……これは、何かの間違いで……",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line068",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a8f9d53322676d2f0934a21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "間違い？ 間違えたのは、あなた方が誰を追い出したか、ですよ",
   "emotion_preset": "angry",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.9,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line069",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63478295af3bab65523c3237",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "佐藤さん……お願いだ、助けてくれ……！ 俺が、悪かった……！",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.3,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line070",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6322940059d649937b97f326",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "明日から会社に来るなって言ったのは、君たちの方だろう？",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line071",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6322940059d649937b97f326",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "さあ。ここからが、本当の地獄だ",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.85
  },
  {
   "id": "line072",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "だいとうテクノロジーは、補助金の全額返還と、ひゃくおくえんの損害賠償を求められ、株価は一夜で暴落した。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line073",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "山本専務と田中は、懲戒解雇。電気事業法違反と詐欺の疑いで、刑事告訴された。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line074",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "さらに田中個人にも、浮かせたさんおくえんをめぐって、会社からの損害賠償請求が突きつけられた。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line075",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_64a66e30679f68b9bf301edb",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "佐藤さん。私も、ここで働かせてください",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line076",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6322940059d649937b97f326",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……約束を守った技術者を、断る理由はないさ",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.7,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line077",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "佐藤が最後まで守ろうとしたのは、会社ではなかった。そこで働く、人の命だった。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line078",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "誠実に積み上げた技術は、誰にも奪えない。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line079",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_629fe972013e90b4db213fd8",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "最後までご覧いただき、ありがとうございました。スカッとした方は、ぜひチャンネル登録と高評価をお願いします",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line080",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_629fe972013e90b4db213fd8",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "あなたの職場にも、田中のような上司はいますか？ コメントで教えてください",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line081",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_629fe972013e90b4db213fd8",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "それでは、また次回お会いしましょう",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  }
 ]
}